# Vigor frontend environment
#
# SECURITY: only NON-SECRET values may live here. Anything referenced with
# VITE_* is bundled into the browser and is therefore public. Never place
# API keys, database credentials or AI provider keys in this file.
#
# Base URL of the Spring Boot REST API (Phase 2+). Leave empty to use the
# temporary in-browser mock API (clearly labelled as demo data).
#   - Absolute URL: the app loads its core dataset from the backend.
#     Example when the backend runs locally (see ../backend/README.md):
#       VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
#   - '/' (same-origin mode): on-demand modules (real competition data) fetch
#     relative /api/... through the dev-server proxy (vite.config.ts) or a
#     co-deployed backend; the core dataset stays the in-browser demo one.
#       VITE_API_BASE_URL=/
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
